This repository also contains code from other projects. These parts remain under the terms of their original authors:

- FlowChain (Maeda and Ukita, ICCV 2023), https://github.com/meaten/FlowChain-ICCV2023
  The forecasting model in src/models and the data structures and data loading in src/data are taken from or adapted from FlowChain.
  The folder runtime/src holds a second copy of these parts (models, data, metrics, utils.py and default_params.py) for the runtime experiments.

- Trajectron++ (Salzmann et al., ECCV 2020), https://github.com/StanfordASL/Trajectron-plus-plus, MIT License
  FlowChain builds on the data structures and the encoder of Trajectron++.

The runtime benchmarks in runtime/ use Ultralytics (https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics) for detection and tracking.
